<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-CHILE DISQUALIFIED.</title>
<headline>GOLF-CHILE DISQUALIFIED.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile were disqualified from the World Cup of Golf on Friday after Guillermo Encina signed for an incorrect score in the second round.</p>
</text>
